> All cmevla are cmene,
This is a bold claim. Proof it to me.

Remember that =E2=80=9Ccmene=E2=80=9D does *not* focus on morphology. It do=
es not even
focus on the language. I didn=E2=80=99t even go into =E2=80=9Czoi=E2=80=9D =
quotes in my essay.
A cmene is only a cmene if it is actually a name /given to something by
someone/.
On the other hand, =E2=80=9Ccmevla=E2=80=9D *does* care about morphology. S=
o these
concepts probably do not mix so nicely. It is actually not so easy to
claim that all cmevla are cmene. Unless you can proof it.

And analogies don=E2=80=99t proof anything.

