cmevla. Cmevla have other properties in Lojban, for example: they can
use the diphtongs =E2=80=9Ciy=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Cuy=E2=80=9D and they ca=
n all the vowel pairs with
a =E2=80=9Cy=E2=80=9D in it, like =E2=80=9Ca'y=E2=80=9D. No other word clas=
